-- S20 -- «B15»: A QUEUE THAT IS WRITTEN ONCE.
--
-- `FRAGMENTE.md` «B15»: *"No type application: `Outcome(T,E)`, `Queue(T,N)`
-- unwritable; `variants` takes exactly one `typeexpr` per variant, multi-field
-- payloads need helper structs."* Cited at F1 and F3. F3 wrote its ring buffer
-- MONOMORPHISED for that reason.
--
-- This is the one that decides whether a standard library can exist: `TODO.md`
-- §0 defers the library on the grounds that *"the language mechanism exists
-- (`library fn` with `payload`, `@lib#fn(...)` calls) -- what does not exist is
-- content: no memory copy, no ring buffer, no queue, no strings"*. A ring
-- buffer without type application is one ring buffer per element type.
--
-- MEASURED, AND THE RESULT IS WORSE THAN «B15» SAYS.
--
-- (1) `type Queue(T) = { kopf : u32, ende : u32, };`  **0 errors, emit rc=0.**
--     The parenthesised list PARSES: `typedecl = … "type" ident
--     [ "(" typelist ")" ] …` (`SYNTAX.md`:333). It is there for
--     `linear ghost type Held(Lock)` -- a TYPE LIST on a ghost mark, not a
--     type PARAMETER -- and on an ordinary `type` nothing reads it.
--     Differential, `gabbro emit` of `type Queue(T) = …` against
--     `type Queue = …`: **C BYTE-IDENTICAL, obligation register unchanged.**
--     A clause that moves neither the artefact nor the register is the
--     `UNCOVERED` cell of `instrumente/miss-grammatikdeckung.py`, and this one
--     looks exactly like the feature it is not.
--
-- (2) Using the parameter is where it stops, and the refusal is at the
--     EMITTER, not at the checker:
--
--       type Queue(T) = { kopf : u32, w : T, };
--       gabbro pruefe : 0 errors, 0 hints
--       gabbro emit   : [C001] ...:31: no lowering: field type
--
-- (3) The other two spellings do not parse at all:
--
--       type  Queue<T> = { … };        P001  `;` expected, `<` found
--       table Queue(T) count NQ { … }  P001  `{` expected, `(` found
--
-- So: a writer can declare `Queue(T)`, be told nothing, and find out at the
-- emitter that the parameter was never a parameter.
--
-- The `variants` half of «B15» moved: a `tagged type` has a constructor since
-- lane 167 (`OFFEN.md` O8), and `beispiele/120` builds one.
--
-- The file below carries shape (2).

module schreibprobe::typanwendung {

const NQ : u32 = 16;

type Queue(T) = { kopf : u32, ende : u32, w : T, };

}
